  reel_script says the Avinashi–Mettupalayam road runs from Avinashi to Mettupalayam, which matches; however slides_spec line 'கருவலூர், அன்னூர் வழியாகச் செல்கிறது' is fine, but the slide title 'பக்தர்களின்' is an incomplete, ungrammatical heading with no clear meaning
  slides_spec line 'அறநிலையத்துறை, தாலுகா அலுவலகத்தில் மனு' mixes two different recipients (Hindu Religious Endowments department and taluk office) into one unclear phrase, and the article says the petition was given to the temple executive officer and the Coimbatore assistant commissioner, not the taluk office, which only received a protest
  reel_script states the temple was declared to be removed for the road only as a notice; the article says the highway department issued the notice, which is correct, but the reel_script says 'அகற்ற வேண்டும் என நெடுஞ்சாலைத் துறை நோட்டீஸ் தந்துள்ளது' which is consistent; however the caption says the petition was given to the taluk office, while the article says the protest (not petition) was lodged there
  caption states the protesters petitioned the taluk office (அன்னூர் தாலுகா அலுவலகத்தில் மனு கொடுத்துள்ளனர்), whereas the article only says they expressed opposition to the taluk office
  reel_script omits the key point that devotees asked the government to widen the road without demolishing the temple by building on the opposite side; it does mention the opposite-side proposal but attributes it generally, and the demand to not demolish the temple is not explicitly stated
